   <text>
      <body><div><pb facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01" n="0122_08_05_1328-01" xml:id="img_0122_08_05_1328-01"/>
            <ab>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_5">Wi jan Wilmaer de roede . en̄ Willem noese scepenen in Antwʼpen maken cond . dat vore</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_6">ons qᵃmen de ministʼ en̄ dcouent vanden broedeʼn vandʼ derdder ordenen in Antwʼpen</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_7">in deen side . En̄ jan canteman shʼ claus cantemans sone in dandʼ side . En̄ be</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_8">kenden in beiden siden . Dat de vorseide jan vʼcocht heeft wetteleke den vorseiden</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_9">ministre en̄ cōuente alle dat ghedeel en̄ recht dat hi jan houdende was ane de</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_10">hofstad en̄ alle dat daer toe hoert die gheleghen es inde cortte mere naest des</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_11">selfs cōuents huisinghe die wilen was jans poertiers en̄ sijns wijfs wilen</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_12">met alle dien rechte dat hi jan houdende was ane dat eyghen en̄ den grond en̄</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_13">dat daer toe hoert ōme ene sūme van ghelde daer af hem de vorseide jan wel</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_14">kende vʼgouden vanden vorseiden cōuente . Voert bekenden si in beiden siden</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_15">dat de vorseide ministʼ en̄ cōuent sculdech sijn alle jare erfleke en̄ euweleke</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_16">dan vorseiden janne en̄ sinen nacomelinghen vandʼ vorseidʼ hofstat en̄ van alle</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_17">den guede dat si ligghende hebben tusschen dese selue hofstat en̄ de veste to-</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_18">te achtʼ ter nuwʼstᵃten . viertiene oude grote tornoise gued en̄ custbaer vā</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_19">sconings monte van vᵃncrike jaerliker en̄ euwelikʼ renten ofte de wʼde daer</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_20">ane in gueden andren paim̄te . tegheldene en̄ tegheuene alle jare vanden</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_21">vorseiden ministʼ en̄ cōuente die daer nv sijn en̄ namaels sijn selen .. den</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_22">vorseiden janne en̄ sinen nacomelinghen telken sente steuens daghe</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_23">naest den kerstdaghe . en̄ daertoe Drie C capune altoes elcs jaers ten</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_24">seluen daghe . Jn kinnessen van desen letteʼn beseghelt met onsen seglen . Gheghe-</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_25">uen jnt jaer ons heʼn alsm̄ screef . M . CCC . achte en̄ twintech des sondaegs nae</l>
               <l facs="#facs_0122_08_05_1328-01_tr_1_tl_26">aldʼ apostelen dach</l>
            </ab>
      </div></body>
